  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Consolidation of Humanitarian and Recovery Efforts through High-Quality Data Aggregation and Evidence-Based Programming</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Ukraine has continued to suffer immense damage and significant displacement of the population that finds itself in gravely vulnerable situations. To provide assistance IOM proposes to strengthen its assessments and data generation, coordination, and evidence-based governance, with the aim to help governments, humanitarian and other actors to help address challenges and better consolidate humanitarian and recovery interventions in support of the war-affected population in Ukraine.</narrative>
  </description>
